== Data (downloaded by the user; not redistributed) ==

ClimbMix: karpathy/climbmix-400b-shuffle (a reshuffle of NVIDIA ClimbMix), CC BY-NC 4.0. Pretraining data of both
  models (75% of the 124M model's), App. C.8 pre+mid+RL pretraining text and held-out loss text.

OLMo 3 Dolmino mix: allenai/dolma3_dolmino_mix-100B-1025 (revision f23942ae for the 240M-token corpus), ODC-By 1.0;
  its components keep their own licences and terms. 25% of the 124M model's pretraining data, the 0.76B model's midtraining data, the 240M-token midtraining
  corpus of Sec. 5.2 (built by src/unified_training/tools/build_document_anchor.py), App. C.8 pre+mid+RL pretraining text and
  held-out loss text.

nl_tower puzzles, test sets, RL prompt mixes and midtraining traces (HF datasets sfanm/nltower-env,
  sfanm/nltower-rl-mixes, sfanm/nltower-traces-tw1X) are generated by this repository's generator and solver; no
  language model wrote any trace.

